ction of samples  in the wet lab with the  sample size and doses there were 10  samples  per category and if this sample size  increased we could have more accurate  results  and we should also have in between doses  in in between our four categories of  doses  and we also look forward to  research conducted on humans and  astronauts directly  and that's because that's because as  much as we can  analyze samples from mice we do not know  how the mechanism truly works in humans  so um there are some researches that  collect  samples from astronauts but since the  durations  of that astronauts are out in space is  much longer  that uh that is another limitation for  those researches and  here is my references  and i'd like to thank everyone for  attending and listening and i would like  to thank everyone at pine biotech for  their help  and especially harpreet kohr and  ilya brotzky because they were my  mentors  and they helped me a lot during this  research and thank you to rutwi for  uh initiating the cyomics  seminars because i think they're quite  helpful

